                "message": "Exclude the suite opened by a coverage exclusion\n\nAn exclusion matched only its own line, so the body of a TYPE_CHECKING\nblock was still reported as missing. Mark the indented suite excluded\nand leave a following else clause or a non-suite pragma line alone.",
